#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:69
msgid "Step 1 — Deploy the Video Generation Model"
msgstr "步骤 1 — 部署视频生成模型"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:74
msgid ""
"Apply it and wait for the pod to become ready. The model is loaded from "
"the host path ``/data00/models/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers`` (mounted at "
"``/models``), so the weights must already be present on the node:"
msgstr ""
"应用清单并等待 Pod 就绪。模型从主机路径 ``/data00/models/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers`` "
"加载（挂载到 ``/models`` ），因此权重必须已存在于该节点："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:82
msgid ""
"To serve a different vLLM-Omni model (a different video model, or an "
"image/audio one like ``qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml``), swap the container's "
"``vllm serve <model>`` argument, ``--served-model-name``, and the "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name``/Service name — the request shape stays the same "
"as long as the model belongs to the same task family. See vLLM-Omni's "
"`supported models list <https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/vllm-"
"omni/en/stable/>`_."
msgstr ""
"若要服务其他 vLLM-Omni 模型（其他视频模型，或 ``qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml`` 这类图像/音频模型），替换容器的 "
"``vllm serve <model>`` 参数、``--served-model-name`` ，以及 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name``/Service 名称。只要模型属于同一任务族，请求形态保持不变。参见 vLLM-Omni 的 "
"`支持模型列表 <https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/vllm-omni/en/stable/>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:87
msgid "Step 2 — Access the Gateway"
msgstr "步骤 2 — 访问网关"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:89
msgid "Port-forward the Envoy service to test locally:"
msgstr "将 Envoy 服务端口转发到本地以便测试："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:101
msgid "In production, use the LoadBalancer external IP instead:"
msgstr "生产环境请改用 LoadBalancer 外部 IP："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:114
msgid "Step 3 — Generate a Video Synchronously"
msgstr "步骤 3 — 同步生成视频"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:116
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/videos/sync`` blocks until generation completes and returns "
"the raw MP4 bytes directly. Both video endpoints take ``multipart/form-"
"data`` — do **not** set ``-H \"Content-Type: application/json\"``."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/videos/sync`` 会阻塞直到生成完成，并直接返回原始 MP4 字节。两个视频接口均接受 ``multipart"
"/form-data``——**不要** 设置 ``-H \"Content-Type: application/json\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:136
msgid ""
"**Image-to-video**: VACE also supports using a reference image as the "
"starting frame — pass it via ``input_reference``:"
msgstr "**图生视频** ：VACE 也支持将参考图像作为起始帧——通过 ``input_reference`` 传入："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:153
msgid "Step 4 — Generate a Video Asynchronously"
msgstr "步骤 4 — 异步生成视频"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:155
msgid ""
"For longer generations, ``POST /v1/videos`` returns immediately with a "
"job ID while generation continues in the background — poll for status and"
" fetch the result once it's done. The ID you get back is the gateway's "
"own opaque public job ID (``aibrixjob-...``), not the engine's; use it "
"everywhere below."
msgstr ""
"对于较长的生成，``POST /v1/videos`` 立即返回任务 ID，生成在后台继续——轮询状态，完成后获取结果。你拿到的 ID "
"是网关自己的不透明公开任务 ID（``aibrixjob-...``），不是引擎的；下面各处都使用它。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:157
msgid "**Submit the job:**"
msgstr "**提交任务：**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:178
msgid ""
"The ``user`` header is what scopes the job: every follow-up call below "
"must send the same value, or the gateway will answer ``404`` — a job "
"belonging to another scope is indistinguishable from one that does not "
"exist. Omit it consistently and the job lands in the shared scope "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"``user`` 头决定任务作用域：下面每次后续调用都必须发送相同的值，否则网关会返回 "
"``404``——属于其他作用域的任务与不存在的任务无法区分。始终省略该头，则任务进入共享作用域。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:180
msgid ""
"The raw response (before extracting ``.id``) looks like this — note that "
"``id`` is the gateway's public job ID, substituted for the engine's. The "
"same shape is returned by the poll step below, with ``status``, "
"``progress``, and ``completed_at`` updated as generation proceeds:"
msgstr ""
"提取 ``.id`` 之前的原始响应如下——注意 ``id`` 是网关的公开任务 ID，已替换引擎 "
"ID。下方轮询步骤返回同样的形状，并随着生成推进更新 ``status``、``progress`` 和 ``completed_at``："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:207
msgid ""
"**Poll status** until it reports ``completed`` or ``failed``. The gateway"
" resolves the public ID and transparently pins the request to the pod "
"that created the job, regardless of which pod would normally be picked by"
" its routing policy:"
msgstr ""
"**轮询状态**，直到报告 ``completed`` 或 ``failed``。网关解析公开 ID，并透明地把请求钉到创建该任务的 "
"Pod，无论其路由策略通常会选哪个 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:213
msgid "**Download the result** once ``completed``:"
msgstr "状态为 ``completed`` 后**下载结果** ："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:219
msgid ""
"**List your jobs** instead of polling one by ID. This is the gateway's "
"own catalog for your scope, so no ``model`` parameter is needed. It "
"follows the OpenAI Videos cursor shape: ``limit`` is 1--100 (default 20),"
" ``order`` is ``asc`` or ``desc`` (default ``desc``), and ``after`` is "
"the ``last_id`` from the previous page:"
msgstr ""
"**列出你的任务**，而不是按 ID 轮询某一个。这是网关为你的作用域维护的目录，因此不需要 ``model`` 参数。它遵循 OpenAI "
"Videos 游标形状：``limit`` 为 1--100（默认 20），``order`` 为 ``asc`` 或 ``desc``（默认 "
"``desc``），``after`` 是上一页的 ``last_id``："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:221
msgid ""
"The ``after`` value is a live catalog cursor: the referenced job must "
"still exist in the same owner scope. If that job is deleted or expires "
"before the next page is requested, the gateway returns ``400 invalid "
"video list cursor or parameters``. Restart the listing without ``after``;"
" a public job ID intentionally contains no creation timestamp from which "
"the deleted position could be recovered."
msgstr ""
"``after`` 值是活动的目录游标：被引用的任务必须仍存在于同一所有者作用域。若该任务在请求下一页之前被删除或过期，网关返回 ``400 "
"invalid video list cursor or parameters``。去掉 ``after`` 重新开始列举；公开任务 ID "
"有意不包含创建时间戳，因此无法从中恢复已删除位置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:249
msgid ""
"The catalog reports what the gateway knows: the job's identity, model, "
"and retention window. It does not call the backend, so it carries no live"
" ``status`` or ``progress`` — poll the job by ID for those. Video "
"endpoint paths are exact; ``/v1/videos/`` and other trailing-slash "
"variants return ``404``."
msgstr ""
"目录报告网关所知道的内容：任务身份、模型和保留窗口。它不调用后端，因此没有实时 ``status`` 或 ``progress``——按 ID "
"轮询任务以获取这些。视频端点路径是精确匹配的；``/v1/videos/`` 及其他带尾斜杠的变体返回 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:251
msgid ""
"**Delete a job** once you no longer need it. The record is removed once "
"the backend confirms the delete (``2xx``) or reports it already gone "
"(``404``); a backend ``5xx`` leaves the record in place so you can retry:"
msgstr ""
"**删除任务** （不再需要时）。后端确认删除（``2xx`` ）或报告已经不存在（``404`` ）后，记录才会被移除；后端 ``5xx`` "
"会保留记录以便重试："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:260
msgid "Text-to-Speech"
msgstr "文本转语音"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:262
msgid ""
"vLLM-Omni's ``POST /v1/audio/speech`` synthesizes speech from text. It is"
" a JSON request with a binary audio response, so — like the image and "
"synchronous video endpoints — it needs none of the video job machinery: "
"the gateway routes it to the pods of the requested model and streams the "
"audio back untouched."
msgstr ""
"vLLM-Omni 的 ``POST /v1/audio/speech`` 将文本合成为语音。它是 JSON 请求、二进制音频响应，因此——与图像和同步视频"
"端点一样——不需要任何视频任务机制：网关会将其路由到所请求模型的 Pod，并把音频原样流式返回。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:277
msgid "What differs from the other endpoints:"
msgstr "与其他端点不同之处："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:279
msgid ""
"``model`` is required. The gateway needs the name to select a pod, so a "
"request without one is rejected with ``400``."
msgstr "``model`` 为必填项。网关需要模型名来选择 Pod，因此缺少该字段的请求会以 ``400`` 被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:280
msgid ""
"``input`` is required and cannot be empty. It is the text to synthesize "
"and is also the routing text for prefix-cache-aware routing."
msgstr "``input`` 为必填项且不能为空，是要合成的文本，同时也是前缀缓存感知路由使用的路由文本。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:281
msgid ""
"Every other field, such as ``voice``, ``response_format``, ``speed``, "
"``instructions``, ``language``, and ``stream_format``, is forwarded as "
"sent and validated by the engine."
msgstr ""
"其他字段，例如 ``voice`` 、 ``response_format`` 、 ``speed`` 、 ``instructions`` 、 ``language`` 和 "
"``stream_format`` ，都会原样转发，由引擎校验。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:282
msgid ""
"The response is binary audio, which the engine may send in several "
"chunks. The gateway forwards it byte for byte and never parses it as JSON"
" or as an SSE stream, so a request-level ``stream`` field does not turn "
"on SSE handling. Nothing about a successful body is parsed, so no token "
"usage is reported."
msgstr ""
"响应为二进制音频，引擎可能分多个分块发送。网关逐字节转发，绝不将其解析为 JSON 或 SSE 流，因此请求级的 ``stream`` "
"字段不会开启 SSE 处理。成功响应体不会被解析，因此不上报 token 用量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/vllm-omni.rst:283
msgid ""
"Unlike the ``/v1/videos`` endpoints, this one takes ``application/json``:"
" do **not** send ``multipart/form-data``."
msgstr "与 ``/v1/videos`` 各端点不同，此端点接收 ``application/json`` ：请 **不要** 发送 ``multipart/form-data`` 。"

